#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/blfs-git/xfce/apps/xfce4-pulseaudio-plugin.xml:30
#, xml-text
msgid "Introduction to the Xfce4 Pulseaudio Plugin"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/blfs-git/xfce/apps/xfce4-pulseaudio-plugin.xml:33
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The <application>Xfce4 Pulseaudio Plugin</application> is a plugin for the "
"Xfce panel which provides a convenient way to adjust the audio volume of the"
" PulseAudio sound system and to an auto mixer tool like pavucontrol. It can "
"optionally handle multimedia keys for controlling the audio volume."
msgstr ""

